  "title": "Perfect Turkey",
  "description": "Looking for the best way to cook a turkey? This recipe uses a brine to make a roast turkey extra moist and flavorful. Perfect for Thanksgiving!",
  "authors": [
    "Shelly White"
  ],
  "date_published": "2001-11-19T21:24:17-05:00",
